{#
    Which household this is, how many people are in it, and what you are in it.

    A label, not a control: no chevron and no menu, because there is one
    household per session and nothing to switch to (decision 16). Drawn in the
    rail and again at the top of the narrow screen's More sheet.

    `household`  a HouseholdLabel
#}
<div class="household-label">
    {{ icon('home', 'household-label-icon') }}
    <div class="household-label-text">
        <p class="household-label-name">{{ household.name }}</p>
        <p class="household-label-meta">
            {{ t('shell.household_meta', {
                'count': household.memberCount,
                'role': t(household.role.labelKey())
            }) }}
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
